{"ID":"20260620204825-b6ths48","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260620204825-b6ths48","title":"流程脚本","type":"doc","updated":"20260626180644"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260621202620-2erydxm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260621202620-2erydxm","updated":"20260621202641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏流程三个阶段"}]},{"ID":"20260620204825-3le9wda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260620204825-3le9wda","updated":"20260621150238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"一阶段"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不知道有鬼阶段（没有异常和刚出现异常但不确定是否非自然）——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"二阶段"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"知道有鬼但不知道怎么处理的纯恐怖被动阶段——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"三阶段"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​知道鬼的（假）来历，根据帮助抵抗鬼以及完成仪式的阶段"}]},{"ID":"20260621151114-hvd8vr4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260621151114-hvd8vr4","updated":"20260625022546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简略版"}]},{"ID":"20260621141854-e2bdldv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621141854-e2bdldv","updated":"20260624232807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玩家进入游戏——（选择难度）——获取玩家与门的相对位置——点存档——发现有旧存档，且无法操作——创建新存档并载入——开始操控B（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"一阶段"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）——（此时是黄昏）坐在桌子前，有一个清单：父母留的，说这两天我们出差，你记得把每天的家务处理好，然后做你自己的事（玩游戏）——此时交互游戏机会显示“里面的游戏都玩过很多遍了，要玩也是先做完家务再玩吧”——去做家务，这个过程设计好路线，尽可能让他熟悉房间构造——做完刚要回去玩游戏，听到楼下的敲门声——过去后发现送来的游戏卡带，以及一封匿名信，说是某个朋友送给自己的惊喜礼物，门口空无一人——主角很开心地回去插入卡带玩新游戏——遇到和玩家玩游戏一样的主界面以及存档情况（有一个无法干涉的旧存档）——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"主角玩着玩着游戏，突然失去了对控制角色的控制权，然后里面的角色突然转头看向主角（A1）。此时主角卧室房门突然打开，以及一个水杯（或者什么）掉在地上"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——主角受惊放下游戏机，起身查看，发现可能只是走廊对侧的风太大，把房门吹开（房门向里开）以及吹掉了水杯，且此时已经到了夜晚——回去继续玩游戏（A2），然后听到一楼传来动静，以为是父母回来了，过去查看，结果空无一人，并且大门被从外面封住——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"进入二阶段"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在往回走的路上直接遇到灵异事件，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"此处对关卡设计有需求"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），B被迫绕路且被惊吓着往屋里跑——回去后锁住门，门口传来一会儿拍门声与吼叫声后消失（玩家门口也会出现），此时他发现游戏机里的人看着他并发出笑声，他意识到这个游戏可能不太对劲，于是打开电脑搜索这个游戏名，发现没有任何相关信息，于是去论坛上求助，有一个人回应，表示自己的家族曾经是巫师的一脉，他听说过一种夺舍术法，能把冤魂寄宿在书籍里，随着信息的摄入，冤魂就会出现在现实中不断干扰受害者的现实生活，甚至加害于他，只有读完信息体会了冤魂的痛苦，并随后剔除掉书上的契印，冤魂才能被超度。对方认为主角现在正在玩的游戏是这种巫术的现代变体，恐怕必须要玩完游戏全程，并删除掉旧存档，才能超度冤魂——并告诉了他与鬼对抗的方法，对方可以支援邮递某种驱邪道具过来，他接下来需要在鬼的追击下利用道具来和鬼周旋，一边躲避追击一边完成剩余的游戏流程——在等待送来快递的时候完成（A3）——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"进入三阶段"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 一段gameplay，此时鬼被门阻挡拍门时玩家也能听到自己被拍门，玩家边躲鬼边完成剩下游戏流程（A4）（我想在这段来一段后朋些的配乐）——最终完成了游戏流程，按照要求回到自己的房间，给门贴上符咒，在鬼的一阵阵拍门声与怒吼声中删除了旧存档。这时候外面传来逐渐微弱的惨叫声，游戏里的主角A也再次meta乱入到屏幕上，告诉了他事情的真相，主角意识也逐渐模糊——逐渐闪回他当时变为游魂那部分的绝望记忆——再次醒来时已经是从屏幕往外看的视角，自己的身体已经被A夺舍，A发表胜利宣言（——游戏黑屏，B讲述自己的结局，然后随着言说事情变得不对起来，使玩家意识到自己也完成了被夺舍的条件，且自己的门外不断传来拍门声与怒吼声，屏幕跳到存档界面，此时锁定旧存档，返回、删除、读取键全都变成“删除”。玩家被迫点后或10秒不点自动点后一切寂静下来，游戏结束并附上开发者感谢黑屏。"}]},{"ID":"20260621143447-tzzsgkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260621143447-tzzsgkd","updated":"20260621202101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（注：此处的A1 A2 A3 A4是代指玩游戏机的4段流程区分）"}]},{"ID":"20260621202103-i0q0j25","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260621202103-i0q0j25","updated":"20260626180644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"详细版"}]},{"ID":"20260625022554-ptjxkgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260625022554-ptjxkgn","updated":"20260626161850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玩家进入游戏——（选择难度）——获取玩家与门的相对位置——点存档——发现有旧存档，且无法操作——创建新存档并载入——开始操控B（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一阶段"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）"}]},{"ID":"20260626161828-ycya57e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626161828-ycya57e","updated":"20260626161905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-info-background); color: var(--b3-card-info-color);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"B1"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-card-info-background); color: var(--b3-card-info-color);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："}]},{"ID":"20260626161828-6e55gg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626161828-6e55gg3","updated":"20260626161848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"一段运镜"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，从外面的走廊窗户，到进入窗户来到走廊，经过一面镜子，球朝着远离镜子的方向滚动，经过一个上面放着水杯的桌子，再跨过房门进入B的卧室，先经过父母留的纸条（不做停留，只做提醒），最后停在游戏机上，然后以B的手伸到桌子上按住清单结束，摄像头重叠到主角头上）——坐在桌子前，有一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"清单"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：父母留的，说这两天我们出差，你在家里好好呆着，把家务做好，不要再到处惹事——此时交互游戏机会显示“里面的游戏都玩过很多遍了，要玩也是先做完家务再玩吧”——去做家务，这个过程设计好"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"路线"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，尽可能让他熟悉房间构造，能把最后追逐对抗战可以走的联通路线全走完——做完刚要回屋，听到楼下的敲门声——过去后发现送来的游戏卡带，以及一封匿名信，说是某个朋友（称自己为大哥）送给自己的惊喜礼物，门口空无一人——主角回去插入卡带玩新游戏——遇到和玩家玩游戏一样的主界面以及存档情况（有一个无法干涉的旧存档）——"}]},{"ID":"20260626155913-jwl1f87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626155913-jwl1f87","updated":"20260626161131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);"},"TextMarkType":"mark text","TextMarkTextContent":"A1"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："}]},{"ID":"20260626160445-du2t336","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626160445-du2t336","updated":"20260626163044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景一，有点破败、沿途有好几个垃圾桶的美国街巷，比较长，是A的上学路——A走在上学路，自述自己的家庭背景，场景终点处交互开门（以后每个场景连接也是开门，不再重复）"}]},{"ID":"20260626160631-9des3hi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626160631-9des3hi","updated":"20260626162441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景二，学校食堂，背景里还有不少在吃饭的人影——这里先有个按E吃饭，A进行到上面那段叙述的结尾，然后餐盘被B故意碰掉，讲述自己被B欺负的开始"}]},{"ID":"20260626160816-dd9obon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626160816-dd9obon","updated":"20260626173924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景三，更衣室，A第一次被B带人揍了一顿（我有点考虑要不要把B和他的跟班们做成魔鬼的形象）——简单展示，被打过程用黑屏处理，被打完A坐在那里带着怨气地叙述着，接着突然不说话，然后慢慢盯着屏幕外的玩家（这里要一个阴阳脸打光）"}]},{"ID":"20260626161837-50ga0ci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626161837-50ga0ci","updated":"20260626161909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-info-background); color: var(--b3-card-info-color);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"B2"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-card-info-background); color: var(--b3-card-info-color);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："}]},{"ID":"20260626155913-am6k2b0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626155913-am6k2b0","updated":"20260626161924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——B对此感到惊慌，此时B卧室房门突然打开，以及一个水杯（或者什么）从外面滚了进来——B受惊放下游戏机，起身查看，发现可能只是走廊对侧的风太大，把房门吹开（房门向里开）以及吹掉了水杯，且发现此时已经到了夜晚——回去继续玩游戏——"}]},{"ID":"20260626161739-203c06d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626161739-203c06d","updated":"20260626161804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);"},"TextMarkType":"mark text","TextMarkTextContent":"A2"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":":"}]},{"ID":"20260626161806-bhoxenk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626161806-bhoxenk","updated":"20260626162852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景一，家里的餐桌，家比较穷，所以场景最好“烂”一点，背景里不起眼的地方要有电动车和笔记本电脑——与父亲交谈以及演变为吵架"}]},{"ID":"20260626162852-t2icrps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626162852-t2icrps","updated":"20260626163004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"插图一，一座高塔从地面向上仰视的“全身”图"}]},{"ID":"20260626163005-lot1ild","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626163005-lot1ild","updated":"20260626163204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景二，整座高塔的超长背景（可以偷懒重复几次）——爬塔环节"}]},{"ID":"20260626163205-m4lclbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626163205-m4lclbf","updated":"20260626163748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景三，塔的顶部内外，具体来讲有一个不怎么长的延伸平台，里面风格还是塔，外边是星空和下面城市的光亮"}]},{"ID":"20260626163754-94wwgik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626163754-94wwgik","updated":"20260626163819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"插图二，从塔顶向下看城市的俯视图"}]},{"ID":"20260626162213-zuym36n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626162213-zuym36n","updated":"20260626162219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-info-background); color: var(--b3-card-info-color);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"B3"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-card-info-background); color: var(--b3-card-info-color);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："}]},{"ID":"20260626161730-kg9vlso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626161730-kg9vlso","updated":"20260626165140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——听到一楼传来动静，以为是父母回来了，过去查看，结果空无一人，并且大门被从外面封住——"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"进入二阶段"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在往回走的路上直接遇到灵异事件，（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"此处对关卡设计有需求，等做完再设计具体脚本"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），B被迫绕路且被惊吓着往屋里跑——回去后锁住门，门口传来一会儿拍门声与吼叫声后消失（玩家门口也会出现），此时他发现游戏机里的人看着他并发出笑声（带一点报复和苦笑意味的笑声），他意识到这个游戏可能不太对劲，于是打开电脑搜索这个游戏名，发现没有任何相关信息，于是去论坛上求助，有一个人回应，表示自己曾对巫术有一些了解，他听说过一种夺舍术法，能把冤魂寄宿在书籍里，随着信息的摄入，冤魂就会出现在现实中不断干扰受害者的现实生活，甚至加害于他，只有读完信息体会了冤魂的痛苦，并随后剔除掉书上的契印，冤魂才能被超度。对方认为主角现在正在玩的游戏是这种巫术的现代变体，恐怕必须要玩完游戏全程，并删除掉旧存档，才能超度冤魂——并告诉了他与鬼对抗的方法，对方可以支援邮递某种驱邪道具过来（银弹和符咒），他接下来需要在鬼的追击下利用道具来和鬼周旋，一边躲避追击一边完成剩余的游戏流程（由于完成的进度越长，鬼魂的意识清晰度和攻击性越强，所以不能一直躲在屋里完成剩余进度）——在等待送来快递的时候继续完成游戏——"}]},{"ID":"20260626165028-a4ew7fp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626165028-a4ew7fp","updated":"20260626165351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);"},"TextMarkType":"mark text","TextMarkTextContent":"A3"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":":"}]},{"ID":"20260626165352-3q2iijp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626165352-3q2iijp","updated":"20260626165521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景一，用过的更衣室场景——B变本加厉"}]},{"ID":"20260626165523-9gluw20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626165523-9gluw20","updated":"20260626165544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景二，用过的家的场景——偷钥匙"}]},{"ID":"20260626165545-fq75iim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626165545-fq75iim","updated":"20260626165640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景三，地下室场景，比较有巫师地下室那种破败且带点邪性的感觉，色调脏黄一些——阅读典籍，知道自己一族确实是巫师家"}]},{"ID":"20260626165640-eeng7ce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626165640-eeng7ce","updated":"20260626165800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景四，家门口的街道（美国贫困区街道，简而言之就是比中国农村宽敞一点），左上角的背景把那座高塔画上——被B埋伏，开始向塔逃去"}]},{"ID":"20260626165808-iijfx9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626165808-iijfx9x","updated":"20260626170002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-info-background); color: var(--b3-card-info-color);"},"TextMarkType":"mark text","TextMarkTextContent":"B4"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-card-info-background); color: var(--b3-card-info-color);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"/"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);"},"TextMarkType":"mark text","TextMarkTextContent":"A4"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":":"}]},{"ID":"20260626170003-3bg2wsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626170003-3bg2wsr","updated":"20260626180644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"进入三阶段"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，听到楼下的敲门声，B先去阁楼取枪，然后去门口取道具，接下来是一段gameplay，B边躲鬼边完成剩下游戏流程，一边打枪关门溜鬼，一边在游戏机上爬塔，此时鬼被门阻挡拍门时玩家也能听到自己被拍门，（我想在这段来一段后朋风格的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"配乐"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我也不知道为什么（）——最终完成了游戏流程"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（A到达最高层并跳下去）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-card-error-background); color: var(--b3-card-error-color);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，按照要求回到自己的房间，给门贴上符咒，在鬼的一阵阵拍门声与怒吼声中删除了旧存档。这时候外面传来逐渐微弱的惨叫声，B也莫名感到一阵晕眩，向下倒下去，然后又丝滑地从地面平躺位来了个凭空起立，180°翻转到了游戏里地下室的位置，此时外面占据了自己身体的A告诉了他事情的真相——闪回他当时变为游魂那部分的绝望记忆（这里要注意惊悚悬疑的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"音乐"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）——游戏黑屏，B讲述自己的结局，来软的并假装自己是无辜者，求玩家把他解放出来，玩家不删他的存档的话，语气就会逐渐变得不对起来（这里也要注意"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"mark","TextMarkTextContent":"音乐"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"配合），选择来硬的承认自己就是B，恐吓威慑玩家删除存档，使玩家意识到自己也完成了被夺舍的条件，且自己的门外不断传来拍门声与怒吼声，屏幕跳到存档界面，此时锁定旧存档，返回、删除、读取键全都变成“删除”。若玩家在这期间点，则先黑屏然后出现一只大眼睛，放大向玩家“扑过来”。若玩家10秒不点，则一切寂静下来，B对你表示愤恨并将要去搜寻下一个目标——无论如何，接下来游戏结束并附上开发者感谢黑屏。"}]},{"ID":"20260625022543-9dsqqh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260625022543-9dsqqh9","updated":"20260625022546"}}]}